(# Relevance scoring) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TF-IDF weights a term by how often it appears in a document and how rare it is across) Tj T*
(the collection. A term appearing in every document carries little discriminative weight.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BM25 is a probabilistic ranking function that extends TF-IDF with term-frequency) Tj T*
(saturation and document-length normalisation. Saturation means that the tenth occurrence) Tj T*
(of a word adds much less than the second.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The k1 and b parameters control saturation and length normalisation. With b set to 0,) Tj T*
(document length is ignored entirely.) Tj T*
ET
