(# Evaluation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Evaluation uses a test collection of documents, queries and a judgement of which) Tj T*
(documents are relevant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Mean average precision averages precision at each relevant retrieved position over all) Tj T*
(queries. Normalised discounted cumulative gain accounts for graded rather than binary) Tj T*
(relevance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(An inverted index maps each term to the postings list of documents that contain it,) Tj T*
(which is what makes ranked retrieval fast enough to serve interactively.) Tj T*
